        "quarantine_recover": "Recover",
        "quarantine_title": "Project with a problem",
        "release_notes_body": "Update 2136 • 10/02/2026\n\n• Layer panel just like Alight Motion.\n• New effects screen with categories and previews.\n• New effects: CRT Emulator, Dissolve Shake, Displacement Map and Motion Detect.\n• Auto captions, Camera tracking and Mask are now effects.\n• Export as PNG, PNG sequence (.zip) and GIF.\n• Much lighter video export (1 min at 1080p ≈ 108 MB) and a new export screen with a pixel animator.\n• Timeline: each layer moves up and down on its own.\n• Zoom no longer stretches 3D objects; 3D panel in tabs.\n• Motion Tile without black edges.\n• Numbered nulls that don't stack; null parenting fixed.\n• Fixes to Text Transform, the iOS timeline and tablet layout.",
